			<div class="content" id="post-content-2776080">
									

<p>The final log sells it hard. It's long though, and I didn't really feel like I needed the SCP-3000-1 or several of the individual entries in the logs. I also don't really know why women are being thrown away into the pit. You'd think they'd be converted to SCP-3000-1's faster, or used in the river of fat churning out new books.</p>
<p>but the final long sells it well. Particularly in describing the oily fat and the descriptions of texture. Texture is the bessst. Upvoted heartily, with incredible glee! It truly made me smile! :)</p>

							</div>

